{"product_id":"angel-fire","title":"Angel Fire","description":"\u003cp\u003eOnly Willow has the power to defeat the malevolent Church of Angels - and they will stop at nothing to destroy her. However, Willow is not alone. She is with Alex, a trained Angel Killer - and her one true love. Together, they must train a new generation of Angel Killers. But as a half-angel, Willow can't help feeling like an outcast, even with Alex by her side. So when a handsome stranger with a tortured past arrives at the AK camp, Willow finds herself inextricably drawn to him.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 130 x 198\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: L.A. Weatherly\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781409522010\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 512\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45898399285401,"sku":"17RE-2-9781409522010","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/69181ddd47304_Angel_Fire__1.jpg?v=1763202607","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/angel-fire","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}